LOCATION:North Hall 2111
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Rebekah Dix\, Stanford\nHosted by: David Silver\n\nI
  am a postdoctoral fellow at the Stanford Institute for Economic Policy 
 Research (2026–27). I will join Stanford University as an Assistant Pr
 ofessor of Economics in July 2027. My primary research field is industri
 al organization\, including work on innovation and health. I received a 
 BA from the University of Wisconsin–Madison in 2019\, a PhD in economi
 cs from MIT in 2025\, and was previously a postdoctoral fellow at the Co
 wles Foundation at Yale University.\n\nhttps://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all/
 2027/care-seminar-rebekah-dix-stanford
URL:https://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all/2027/care-seminar-rebekah-dix-stanfo
