DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Audrey Guo\, Santa Clara University\nHosted by: Yous
 sef Benzarti\n\nMy research interests include Public\, Labor\, and Healt
 h economics\, with a focus on social insurance and firm responses to tax
 ation. I received my PhD in Economics from Stanford University\, and joi
 ned Santa Clara University as an Assistant Professor of Economics in Fal
